Source-record limitation: The cleaned question omits uniformity over variable or matrix sizes, which is essential to distinguish the cited problem from ordinary decidable finite polynomial nonnegativity.
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Determine whether nonnegativity of a symmetric polynomial is decidable when there is only one group of variables, and whether the analogous problem is decidable for a single matrix variable. \href{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2025/9}{[S2]}
